	(text "RS-485 transceiver for this port (port A: U14, R49, R51, C25. port B: U15, R50, R52, C26).\nDE pulldown keeps the driver off while the MCU resets or is being flashed.\nR51/R52 120 ohm termination is not fitted: the smart cable is short. Fit it only if the bus rings.\nNo TVS on A/B: anything that clamps below 14.6 V would conduct if the battery touched A or B.\nThe MAX33071E bus pins survive +/-65 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 101.6 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8a6b3cb9-42ee-417c-a031-87f6a6502552")))
